imations, all of which are portrayed graphically. All characters in the game are over the age of 18. The content also features references to occult themes, and group sex/orgies."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/c6ec16d9979eca04d0340ee5884114ff.avif?t=1764635734\" width=599 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic Pussy: Chapter 3 is a prequel to our well-known series, so no prior knowledge of the previous games is necessary to enjoy it. Matter of fact, if you\u2019re new to the series - this is the perfect place to start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/c878499b1e29c877c41ce8f9067053fe.poster.avif?t=1764635734\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/c878499b1e29c877c41ce8f9067053fe.webm?t=1764635734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/c878499b1e29c877c41ce8f9067053fe.mp4?t=1764635734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/781fe394efe453e9d3cba17c85d7cd0e.avif?t=1764635734\" width=580 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve decided to go above and beyond this time and to drastically improve every aspect of the game - it now offers various routes to go down and paths to explore, and your decisions influence things more than you can imagine - you weave your own little story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/317ab5cf0d991df227d0ee8562cc1d90.poster.avif?t=1764635734\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/317ab5cf0d991df227d0ee8562cc1d90.webm?t=1764635734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/317ab5cf0d991df227d0ee8562cc1d90.mp4?t=1764635734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of Percival, a redhead heartthrob coming into Wisterwood village with his friends to thwart the ancient cult shenanigans and find their artifacts. Simultaneously, you meet and get to know locals, help them with their own little misfortunes, visit local events and various beautiful locations - the new chapter\u2019s vastly larger in scope than the previous ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/dde68c38603ed10e540fb4d6d1031311.poster.avif?t=1764635734\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/dde68c38603ed10e540fb4d6d1031311.webm?t=1764635734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/dde68c38603ed10e540fb4d6d1031311.mp4?t=1764635734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/extras/71ce4db8beb70ae6e009fa3a1dadca9e.avif?t=1764635734\" width=580 height=310 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exceptional adult animation - no more short looping segments, this time we\u2019ve got full-blown animated sequences with beginnings, pose changes and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speaking of endings - CUM! You\u2019ve asked for it - we\u2019re delivering it. And we\u2019re delivering a lot of it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning graphics - we\u2019re using a new engine, and our skills have grown too, so this time the game looks even better than before!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world - day/night cycle, various locations and freedom of movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters - now with more emotions, different outfits and freedom of movement around the village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immense scope - the demo version is already 2 times bigger than the whole Chapter 2, and it\u2019s barely 1/5 of the game - we\u2019ve got a lot of content, and that's a promise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching plot - your choices make a difference! Experience your unique story - you choose where to go, how to approach different situations and people whom you make friends (and more!) with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diversity - our players asked us to include gay, lesbian, group and similar types of content - and we did! There\u2019s now optional content to suit everyone's tastes.<br>Dive into an open-world adventure featuring many characters and places, an intriguing plot filled with both main and side quests, mini-games, card collectables and lengthy, detailed animations with exceptional graphical quality - we\u2019re pushing the envelope this time!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dirty Adventures \ud83d\udda4"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172300/897081c5426e1a33